  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Desk Study - WIDE AREA MONITORING PROTECTION AND CONTROL, through U.S. Government - Trade and Development Agency</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This $7,000 Desk Study reviews a proposal for a Wide Area Monitoring Protection and Control (WAMPAC) Technical Assistance project identified by Power Grid Corporation India Limited (PGCIL) in India. The proposed assistance will help PGCIL decision makers understand developing power transmission trends, implement real-time solutions and improve transmission and distribution networks within India.</narrative>
  </description>
